#: lib/tuist_web/live/integrations_live.html.heex:516
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Create a GitLab runner with your Tuist profile tags, disable untagged jobs, and paste its token here. Select the machine in your pipeline with tags such as [tuist-macos]."
msgstr "使用您的 Tuist 設定檔標籤建立 GitLab 執行程式，停用無標籤任務，並將其權杖貼到此處。在您的管線中使用如 [tuist-macos] 的標籤來選擇機器。"

#: lib/tuist_web/live/integrations_live.html.heex:495
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Run GitLab CI jobs on Tuist runners. Choose a machine for each job using pipeline tags."
msgstr "在 Tuist 執行程式上執行 GitLab CI 任務。使用管線標籤為每個任務選擇機器。"

